[component]
name: Define Variable
category: Variables
description: Create a new variable with a starting value and type.

[interaction]
title Define Variable
text! var | Name | total
list type | Type | Number | Number, Text, True/False, List, Dictionary, Nothing (None)
text value | Starting value | 0
help For Text the value is written as a string, other types take an expression.

[template]
<PWCT:NEWSTEP> Define variable <var> (<type>)
<PWCT:IF> <type> == Text
<var|ident> = <value|repr>
<PWCT:ENDIF>
<PWCT:IF> <type> == Number
<var|ident> = <value|or_none>
<PWCT:ENDIF>
<PWCT:IF> <type> == True/False
<PWCT:IF> <value>
<var|ident> = True
<PWCT:ELSE>
<var|ident> = False
<PWCT:ENDIF>
<PWCT:ENDIF>
<PWCT:IF> <type> == List
<var|ident> = [<value>]
<PWCT:ENDIF>
<PWCT:IF> <type> == Dictionary
<var|ident> = {<value>}
<PWCT:ENDIF>
<PWCT:IF> <type> == Nothing (None)
<var|ident> = None
<PWCT:ENDIF>
